Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||09-18-2000||06:42 PM||||I've had more questions about the key not being in the ignition. Actually, <B>every</B> Fiero can drive without the keys in the ignition. You can pull the keys out once the ignition is in the <B>ON</B> position. It's even described in the official Fiero Manual as to why you would want to do that.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
