Z||000010||bHooper||09-18-2000||10:31 PM||||why would you want to drive without the key in the ignition?<P>maybe you need to use the bottle opener for something?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> (i always have a bottle opener on my keychain)<P>------------------<BR>hoop<BR>Red '86 GT||||reg||1
Z||000011||DaRkLoRD||09-18-2000||10:39 PM||||My mom's car did that.. the keys fell out while I was driving with my sister once... it sorta freaked me out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>it was cool.. once I was talking to a friend at the computer store where he worked, and I gave him a ride home.. I tossed him the keys, used the keyless entry to open the car.. started it, and drove him home, and he was holding my keys the whole time..<P>that's not quite the same as the Fiero system, with this ignition, I could start the car without the keys at all.. then we got it replaced.<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||12
