Z||000014||Monkeyman||09-19-2000||03:55 AM||||The "cool-dash" is Eddy Snaauws.  He built it from scratch, then sold the molds to Scott Tilden in Vegas about a month ago.  Supposedly, Scott is planning to market the dash, but I'm beginning to wonder.  I've emailed him numerous times and he hasn't returned any of them (other than the 1st one about the time he bought the molds).||||reg||1
